us/2119535540982976937"}, {"author_id": "1504181287468339208", "created_at": "2026-11-08T22:40:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119560715141107835"], "id": "2119560715141107835", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 78, "impression_count": 12380, "like_count": 744, "quote_count": 6, "reply_count": 24, "retweet_count": 76}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119190677011775856", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "A good reminder that the only guy to defeat communism was Franco, who did it by avoiding crashing out or needlessly alienating those who wanted to stay basically neutral, like the British Conservative government, ruthlessly crushing the ideological communists and the freaks who https://t.co/1Z3VihIdUf https://t.co/pqAD9YUTTe", "url": "https://x.com/Will_Tanner_1/status/2119560715141107835"}, {"author_id": "1972372378609991680", "created_at": "2026-11-08T22:00:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119550542032580713"], "id": "2119550542032580713", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Ivy Fertility Welcomes Aimee Seungdamrong as the Leader of San Diego Fertility Center - Bryant Park\n\nhttps://t.co/oYawqWAXR5\n\n#FertilityNews #Fertility #ReproductiveHealth #ReproductiveMedicine #WomensHealth https://t.co/kdHJZwcSZR", "url": "https://x.com/FertilityOnX/status/2119550542032580713"}, {"author_id": "2072850266504736769", "created_at": "2026-11-08T22:13:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119554047414018420"], "id": "2119554047414018420", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 212, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Europeanization = Low fertility rates for non-whites in Europe\n\nAlthough 1st generation Middle Eastern and African immigrants usually have higher fertility rates, second generation ones usually have just as low fertility rate as native Europeans.", "url": "https://x.com/Alt_Logos_35/status/2119554047414018420"}, {"author_id": "1557925206219423744", "created_at": "2026-11-08T22:38:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119560248423768462"], "id": "2119560248423768462", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 143, "impression_count": 37308, "like_count": 1361, "quote_count": 6, "reply_count": 37, "retweet_count": 39}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116330587694727462", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Holy shit, white fertility rate is now above US general fertility rate. This is amazing, all we have to do is stop the inflows. https://t.co/EuxbLUOgCx", "url": "https://x.com/JohnDoeTheDoe99/status/2119560248423768462"}, {"author_id": "2065399552983576576", "created_at": "2026-11-08T22:49:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119563011073466602"], "id": "2119563011073466602", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 40, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Under current immigration and fertility rates, official Census projections show non-Hispanic White Americans will fall below 50% of the U.S. population by the mid-2040s. Parallel trends are underway in Canada and high-migration Western European countries. The change is produced", "url": "https://x.com/Autonomy6942/status/2119563011073466602"}, {"author_id": "1937359075286876161", "created_at": "2026-11-08T21:26:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119542148261716464"], "id": "2119542148261716464", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Where to find free anime with low virus fertility ratings and pop-up ad genocide?", "url": "https://x.com/retrotendo_69/status/2119542148261716464"}, {"author_id": "4871656217", "created_at": "2026-11-08T22:26:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119557164843061682"], "id": "2119557164843061682", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "1948858460881219968", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "A sustained demographic collapse (low fertility, continued emigration, smaller future workforce) will make servicing that burden harder and will likely force restructuring, longer maturities, or partial forgiveness arguments in the future. https://t.co/wjDx064Bep https://t.co/WmyP79Ul0H", "url": "https://x.com/ColinSumter/status/2119557164843061682"}, {"author_id": "2794570537", "created_at": "2026-11-08T21:40:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119545496226119971"], "id": "2119545496226119971", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 228, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "More devout people have more kids. \n\nBUT, religious leaders being more outspoken about having kids is not associated with any fertility indicator\n\n@lymanstoneky @PeterRFB @FamStudies https://t.co/D36tRfkqeF", "url": "https://x.com/CarterSkeel/status/2119545496226119971"}, {"author_id": "2114380164943818752", "created_at": "2026-11-08T23:01:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119565976786337904"], "id": "2119565976786337904", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Personalised fertility guidance with Dr. Kanchi Khurana, IVF Specialist &amp; Gynaecologist. IVF, PCOD/PCOS management, high-risk pregnancy and recurrent pregnancy loss care. Book a consultation: +91 95922 68354 https://t.co/U2rIW1LH7F", "url": "https://x.com/liamallenhq1/status/2119565976786337904"}, {"author_id": "16568227", "created_at": "2026-11-08T21:23:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119541263561334923"], "id": "2119541263561334923", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 3131, "like_count": 21, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 5}, "text": "Can you guess whose mythological birth is depicted here?\n\nSome clues: \n 🔎 Son of Jupiter and Semele\n 🔎 Raised by nymphs and satyrs\n 🔎 Originally god of fertility, but known for wine https://t.co/PIQ8XsJ4ft", "url": "https://x.com/GettyMuseum/status/2119541263561334923"}, {"author_id": "14662354", "created_at": "2026-11-08T22:10:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119553142056423472"], "id": "2119553142056423472", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1341, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "For the first time on record, women over 40 are having more babies than teenagers. The fertility rate for U.S. women 40 and older has jumped 24% in a decade, from 5.8 births per 1,000 women in 2015 to 7.2 in 2024. https://t.co/lorIaZfc4y", "url": "https://x.com/WashTimes/status/2119553142056423472"}, {"author_id": "2102007768077004800", "created_at": "2026-11-08T21:51:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119548408700752069"], "id": "2119548408700752069", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 72, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Actual fertility goddess https://t.co/HGo81208Ra", "url": "https://x.com/Goonbrah222/status/2119548408700752069"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "1468126921565241345", "name": "Im Tim", "username": "TimDuckToo"}, {"id": "1844822858180014081", "name": "☆Maria☆", "username": "even_Absrder"}, {"id": "26372859", "name": "aonghasn", "username": "aonghasan"}, {"id": "1864433346308091904", "name": "forgin🇦🇿🇹🇷🇮🇱", "username": "huicherezpleco"}, {"id": "1710658905703895040", "name": "✮", "username": "vaneydium"}, {"id": "51429844", "name": "andyd", "username": "andyd10"}, {"id": "1248010790529048579", "name": "Jailer20", "username": "Jailer2005"}, {"id": "1175485171992162305", "name": "NPC_", "username": "MsControversy11"}, {"id": "1504181287468339208", "name": "Will Tanner", "username": "Will_Tanner_1"}, {"id": "1972372378609991680", "name": "Fertility N